      "id": "d4-file-bytes",
      "function": "file_digest",
      "canonical_encoding": "raw-bytes",
      "why": "D4 is the raw sha256 of file BYTES with no canonicalization at all -- bundle.json commits to what is on disk, and `git diff --exit-code attest/` is what keeps the two honest. Canonicalizing here would let the committed bytes drift from the attested ones. The fixture is 120 bytes and ends with a newline; reformatting it rotates this value, which is the property being pinned.",
      "input": {
        "path": "digests/bytes/d4-fixture.txt"
      },
